{"id":"act15d0_level_act15d0_08_end","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_Morgue","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta3_181101/m_bat_longmenbat_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta3_181101/m_bat_longmenbat_loop","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"Son of a...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"jump","xpos":-100,"power":0,"times":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":20,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_sheildimpact","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_blunt_h","delay":0.05,"volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"jump","xpos":100,"power":5,"times":1,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"It's no use, Anthony."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#2","name2":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#2","name2":"avg_npc_137#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Ms. Robin, I'm afraid I've underestimated your fighting prowess. I must say, I'm taking a liking to you more and more by the minute."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"How about it? Help me now, and I will forgive all that you've done."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#2","name2":"avg_npc_137#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Robin","text":"How about no?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#2","name2":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"jump","xpos":100,"power":0,"times":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":20,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_sheildimpact","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"jump","xpos":-100,"power":5,"times":1,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_214_kafka_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kafka","text":"What's with this guy's hand? It's got so hard after it turned black!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Oh, let me introduce you to my Originium Arts. I can control iron. And I've also received a few modifications to my body."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"When you attacked just now, it felt as though you hit an iron plate, didn't it?"},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"That isn't just my Originium Arts at work."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Beneath my skin, I have what I suppose you can aptly call the crystallization of technology, courtesy of Rhine Lab—a tiny metal plating."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Well, I'm afraid I don't know what its proper name is, but it's strong enough to greatly reduce the impact of your attacks."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_214_kafka_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kafka","text":"Hold on, you're from Rhine Lab?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Unfortunately, I'm not."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"In any case, I'm surprised you're able to put up such a fight despite those shackles."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Looks like it's time to get serious."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Robin","text":"His hand... turned into a blade..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Did you know, Mr. Anthony?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Ever since I arrived at the prison, ever since I first laid my eyes on you, I've felt a sort of mismatch."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"You are doing your damnedest to control yourself, to make yourself seem harmless, and to make yourself look well-mannered."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"But you're strength incarnate."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"From that moment onward, I've been waiting for this to happen."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#3","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"So that I can tear off that well-mannered facade of yours and unleash the violence hidden underneath—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#3","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I'm sure I didn't disappoint."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Not at all. You opened my eyes."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"mountain1","name":"char_264_Mountain_1#4","offsetx":0,"width":400,"fadestyle":"horiz_expand_center","fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"You have no right to judge who I am!!! *Roar*!!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"mountain1"}},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"npc137","name":"avg_npc_137#4","offsetx":0,"width":400,"fadestyle":"horiz_expand_center","fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I'm not here to judge. What I'm trying to say is you're much less of an eyesore now."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"npc137"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#4"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"jump","xpos":-100,"power":0,"times":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"jump","xpos":100,"power":0,"times":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_sheildimpact","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":100,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":5,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.04,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_blunt_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_blunt_h","delay":0.05,"volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.04,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":50,"ystrength":50,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":100,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":5,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.04,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_sheildimpact","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.04,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":50,"ystrength":50,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":100,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":5,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_blunt_h","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_blunt_h","delay":0.05,"volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":50,"ystrength":50,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":100,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":5,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Using your teeth too, huh? Tsk, tsk."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I'm sorry to say your teeth won't be able to tear into me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_sheildimpact","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":50,"ystrength":50,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"jump","xpos":100,"power":5,"times":1,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"jump","xpos":-100,"power":5,"times":1,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"...Dammit! Dammit!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Anthony, my friend, is there really all that much you can accomplish outside?"},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Will you be able to save your parents? Your family?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Let me tell you. You'll have nothing once you step out there."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"You're living quite the life here in prison. Even the warden has to kowtow to you."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I may have said I could've killed you long ago, but it wouldn't have been a walk in the park if you didn't go on this little excursion."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Why go through all that trouble? Isn't life in prison plenty comfortable?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"On July 24th six years ago, I was heading to a dinner party when, all of a sudden, a bodyguard told me something had happened back home and my father told me to run."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I had no idea what had happened. I didn't even had the chance to say goodbye to my parents before I went on the run."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I was arrested when I made it to Ironforge."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I thought that was all there was to it, but it didn't take long after I was put in prison for me to find out that wasn't the case."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"The way I'm treated here is not how criminals are usually treated. I realized right away that my father probably arranged for my imprisonment."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Well, what a coincidence. I think so too. But if that's what you think, wouldn't you say that's all the more reason not to betray your father's wishes?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"My father's wishes?"},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"Looks like you really enjoy looking down on people and trying to plot them out, Jesselton."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"Has anyone ever told you how petty you are?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#3","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I've been told that before, indeed."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"But I'm afraid how petty I am has nothing to do with your prison break."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_264_Mountain_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I could live a comfortable life here. I could even turn it into my own little kingdom."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"But what would that get me? It would only make me the prisoner with the most freedom."},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I've lived here for six years, and there was nary a moment when I didn't want to step outside."},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_264_Mountain_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anthony","text":"I want to leave not because I want to prove how amazing I am. I want to leave because I need to figure out just what had happened back home. I need to tell the ones responsible for my family's downfall that we're not done yet!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#3","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"To tell the truth, that impassioned speech is really rubbing me the wrong way."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"char_264_Mountain_1#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"But no big deal. Whatever the case may be, you aren't getting out of this place alive."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I may not be able to take you down, but I've stalled you long enough. The other guards should be here soon as the lockdown ends, too."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"You did well. Your friends did, too. This isn't your fault."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"It's just that most of life in this world ends up unsatisfactory."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Unfortunately, this is as far as you go."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_dooropen","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Listen. Here comes the reaper."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_451_robin#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Robin","text":"So this is it...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_214_kafka_1#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kafka","text":"Tsk, what should we do...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Sorry to disappoint, but the reaper isn't coming just yet."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"On a different note, Anthony, you are way too loud. I could hear you on my way here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Who... are you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Hm? You..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_136#1","blackstart":0.14,"blackend":0.4,"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"I have to hand it to you. Even I was a little surprised by your plan."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"It took me a good while to stop those other guards."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_214_kafka_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kafka","text":"Huh? Where've I seen you before...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Hold on, you..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_136#1","blackstart":0.14,"blackend":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act12d0d0/m_bat_ironguy_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act12d0d0/m_bat_ironguy_loop","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_136#4"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"delay":0.04,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Rhine Lab Defense Director, Saria!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Saria","text":"Right, I remember you, Jesselton."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I'm honored to be remembered by someone as esteemed as you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Saria","text":"Not a lot of resumes make it to my desk."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I remember the moment you told me I didn't get the job too."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"But first, I'm curious. What is Her Highness the Defense Director doing here in a prison?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Saria","text":"You needn't worry about that."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_136#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Saria","text":"All you need to know is that this is where it all ends for you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Where it ends for me?"},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"No, no, no. It seems you're mistaken about something, Director Saria, or should I say just Saria?"},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"I heard your ability isn't all that dissimilar to mine, but before I even had the chance to find out, you'd already slammed the door in my face."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"For all these years, I've wondered whether you're actually stronger than me."},{"t":"line","name":"Jesselton","text":"Looks like we have the chance to find out now."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_137#4","name2":"avg_npc_136#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Saria","text":"Hmph."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_atkboost","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"avg_ac15_9","xscale":1,"yscale":1,"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Kafka","text":"Her hand changed color too!"},{"t":"line","name":"Robin","text":"It'